From 39029e3c6fde4f0d6284f314821bf4ed1449ff84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 24 Nov 2026 07:28:07 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Read "rich" channel posts; upgrade Telethon to 1.45.0

Long research posts with inline photos are sent as message.rich_message
(TL layer 229). Telethon 1.44 (layer 227) does not know the field, so these
posts arrived with empty text and showed up as type "empty" after the
previous change (e.g. aethersemiconductor 27176/27178/27179/27191/27192).

- pin telethon==1.45.0 in the workflow and requirements.txt
- message_fields.message_text(): message text, else the rich blocks
  flattened to plain text (paragraphs, headings, lists, tables, captions)
- rich_photo/rich_document attachments count embedded files (not downloaded)
- collector and app.py use message_text() for the feed text

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017sm19HmKNPSD4tGtrNokTD
